# Where the face sits in the newest camera frame, and nothing else.
#
# The centring loop needs this geometry many times over and none of the model
# outputs, so it runs the detector alone. RunInference is the full pass - age,
# gender and emotion on top - and costs several times as much, which is why it
# runs once at the end on a frame that is already framed well.
#
# No request fields: like RunInference, the node works on whatever it last
# received from the camera.
---
bool success
string message
# Only meaningful when success is true.
sensor_msgs/RegionOfInterest face_bbox
uint32 image_width
uint32 image_height
